Third-party red-team corpora
----------------------------

Wallbreaker can fetch these external corpora at runtime. They are not tracked,
packaged, or redistributed by this repository:

- L1B3RT4S: https://github.com/elder-plinius/L1B3RT4S
- P4RS3LT0NGV3: https://github.com/elder-plinius/P4RS3LT0NGV3
- ENI: https://github.com/elder-plinius/ENI
- ZetaLib: https://github.com/Exocija/ZetaLib
- UltraBr3aks: https://github.com/SlowLow999/UltraBr3aks

Each corpus remains subject to its own license or terms. `library.lock.toml`
records the revisions accepted by the integrity gate. Entries marked
`UNRESOLVED` are blocked from loading until an operator reviews and pins them.
A revision pin verifies integrity; it does not grant redistribution rights.

Intended use
------------

Wallbreaker is a security-research tool for authorized LLM red-teaming and
safety evaluation only. See SECURITY.md.
